  "kind": 1,
  "flags": {},
  "comment": {
    "summary": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Core utilities and types for Probitas client libraries.\n\nThis package provides shared types, error classes, and utilities used across\nall "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`@probitas-test/client-*`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " packages.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Common Options**: Shared configuration types like "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`CommonOptions`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " and "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`RetryOptions`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "\n- **Error Hierarchy**: Base error classes ("
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`ClientError`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": ", "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`ConnectionError`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": ", "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`TimeoutError`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": ", "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`AbortError`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": ")\n\n## Installation\n\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "```bash\nnpm install @probitas-test/client\n```"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "\n\n## Usage\n\nThis package is typically used as a dependency by other client packages.\nEnd users rarely need to import from it directly.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "```ts\nimport type { CommonOptions, RetryOptions } from \"@probitas-test/client\";\nimport { ClientError, ConnectionError, TimeoutError } from \"@probitas-test/client\";\n\n// Use CommonOptions for timeout and abort signal support\nasync function fetchData(options?: CommonOptions) {\n  // Implementation with timeout and signal handling\n}\n\n// Catch and handle errors\ntry {\n  await fetchData({ timeout: 5000 });\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error instanceof TimeoutError) {\n    console.log(`Timed out after ${error.timeoutMs}ms`);\n  } else if (error instanceof ConnectionError) {\n    console.log(\"Failed to connect\");\n  }\n}\n```"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "\n\n## Related Packages\n\n| Package | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| ["
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`@probitas-test/client-http`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@probitas-test/client-http) | HTTP client |\n| ["
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`@probitas-test/client-graphql`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@probitas-test/client-graphql) | GraphQL client |\n| ["
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`@probitas-test/client-grpc`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@probitas-test/client-grpc) | gRPC client |\n| ["
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`@probitas-test/client-connectrpc`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@probitas-test/client-connectrpc) | ConnectRPC client |\n| ["
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`@probitas-test/client-sql-postgres`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
